dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.explain_system=I can §lfuse a gemstone§r into a piece of equipment to grant it extra properties, or §lremove§r a gemstone again. All that for a small fee, of course.\nTo begin, simply interact with the equipment you'd like me to work on.
